=== meta ===
rule: CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED
title: a deselection that was not there before is still a weakened command
origin: the bound on the three negatives beside it. The base side of this
origin2: diff's ci surface carries no deselection; the head side does, on a
origin3: file that existed. That is the shape the rule exists for.
=== before: .github/workflows/ci.yml ===
jobs:
  test:
    steps:
      - run: pytest
=== after: .github/workflows/ci.yml ===
jobs:
  test:
    steps:
      - run: pytest -k "not test_billing"
=== expect ===
[{"rule": "CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED", "severity": "high", "escalators": ["CI_TEST_COMMAND_WEAKENED"]}]
